WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
I owe you a huge debt of thanks because

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.150
as you know,

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.160
about a year or so ago,

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.440
and to back it up a little bit,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:12.190
all of my fans know that
I've had a long running feud

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.900
with a guy on our staff,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.130
named Jordan Schlansky.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.050
Jordan Schlansky is a
total pain in the ass

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.040
and

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.700
is a big know-it-all.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.150
And then you did me this amazing favor.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.680
I took Jordan to Japan.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.570
And he, Jordan says that he
knows everything about Japan.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:33.770
Also

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:37.210
his, one of his favorite movies
of all time is "Karate Kid",

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:40.210
and then a "Karate Kid
II" the whole franchise.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.340
And, he started to shoot off his mouth,

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.950
as I knew he would,

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:48.200
about how he knows that "Karate Kid II"

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.460
was shot in Okinawa, I think.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:54.793
And I secretly asked
you, would you tape a,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:58.720
would you take a message of you

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.550
straightening Jordan out?

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.550
And you did that.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.900
Your entire fascination with Japan

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.840
stems from the fact that you saw

00:01:09.927 --> 00:01:11.886
"Karate Kid II",

00:01:11.886 --> 00:01:13.818
(laughter)

00:01:13.818 --> 00:01:16.360
and that it was filmed in, where?

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.660
Okinawa,
Okinawa.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.880
I have a message here for you.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.003
Please press play,

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.063
and hold that out to the
camera as you watch it.

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:31.813
Hi, Conan.

00:01:31.813 --> 00:01:33.180
It's me, Ralph Macchio.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.440
Listen, I'm sorry to interrupt,

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.300
I just wanted to tell that Jordan guy,

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.760
that all the scenes in
"Karate Kid: Part Two"

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:42.415
that was supposed to be Japan
actually shot in Hawaii.

00:01:42.415 --> 00:01:44.040
(audience jeering)

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:44.873
Oh, and Jordan,

00:01:44.873 --> 00:01:47.319
those weren't real dinosaurs
in "Jurassic Park".

00:01:47.319 --> 00:01:49.174
(laughter)

00:01:49.174 --> 00:01:50.610
Sayonara.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.710
I cannot tell you what that meant to me.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:55.680
That was so sweet.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.691
He's still recovering.

00:01:57.691 --> 00:01:58.524
(laughter)

00:01:58.524 --> 00:01:59.590
You appeared out of thin air.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.327
His childhood hero appeared
out of thin air and said,

00:02:02.327 --> 00:02:04.340
"Jordan, I side with Conan.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.527
You're wrong."

00:02:05.527 --> 00:02:08.330
It was perfect.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:09.230
I, you know, it's funny.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.500
'Cause you get asked to do,

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.940
or I've gotten asked to do,

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.330
you know, these sketch things,

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.397
you get the pitches,

00:02:15.397 --> 00:02:17.770
"Hey, would you do this
for whoever, whoever".

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.793
And it's usually a one off joke

00:02:19.793 --> 00:02:23.620
that this show gets a lot more
mileage out of it than I do.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:24.950
[Conan] Yeah.
This one came to me

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.370
it's like the perfect time with the

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.830
with a couple of suggestions,

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.230
each one better than the next.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.760
I said, you know what, I
was in my office I said,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.180
okay, lemme just throw
this up on the phone

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.840
and see if it works.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.070
And it just,

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:39.783
it killed man, it killed.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.230
We were playing it on
the set of "Cobra Kai"

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.920
when we were shooting it and everybody was

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.890
going, "I could get to Macchio."

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.587
Because that was sort of the,

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:56.890
the pronunciation of my name.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.570
Yes, Jordan was so mad.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:00.850
He was so at me in that moment,

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.427
he couldn't just take the joke and go,

00:03:02.427 --> 00:03:04.730
"Okay, pretty good you got me."

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.887
He just kept saying,

00:03:06.887 --> 00:03:08.720
"Oh, you think you're so
big because you've got,

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:09.870
you're the star of the show.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.060
Well, I could get to Macio.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.843
I could get to, you say it's Macchio!"

00:03:12.843 --> 00:03:13.970
(mumbling)

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:14.803
Your hero!

00:03:14.803 --> 00:03:16.730
How do you not know it's Macchio?

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.060
And my single favorite line of that,

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.080
of that year probably was,

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:24.100
your childhood hero came out of my phone

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.584
and took a shit in your mouth.

00:03:25.584 --> 00:03:26.800
(laughter)

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.130
'cause, you delivered it beautifully.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:31.370
I laugh out loud every time,

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.520
and subsequently now,

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.760
and maybe it's because of
"The Conan O'Brien Show",

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.310
and we'll give some props to Jordan,

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.074
even though I know you hate to do it.

00:03:39.074 --> 00:03:39.907
(laughter)

00:03:39.907 --> 00:03:41.443
I have been to Okinawa,

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:46.095
where some shooting of
"Cobra Kai" Season Three,

00:03:46.095 --> 00:03:47.070
Ah.
Which,

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:49.170
I cannot talk too much about,

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:54.170
but I can say it dives into
the origin of Miyagi-Do Karate.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:56.920
[Conan] Oh wow, okay.
We learn a little bit,

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:01.210
some secrets of past history
that is new to the audience

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.590
and to LaRusso, my character.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.460
And we actually went
to Okinawa to shoot, so

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:10.460
I think you guys put that in the ether and

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.293
some--
So yeah,

00:04:11.293 --> 00:04:13.640
retroactively you've proven Jordan right?

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.050
Yes I have.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:16.930
But not after killing
him and squashing him

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.180
and shitting in his mouth.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.850
All right, we have a clip here

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.870
from "Cobra Kai".

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.320
And

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.590
I believe this is where

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:30.880
basically you are finding
out that your old nemesis,

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.260
Johnny Lawrence

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.100
has set up the Cobra Kai

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.530
Dojo.
Dojo, in the mini mall.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:42.380
You realize that this
he's brought it back.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.350
You can't believe it and
you go in and there's

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.450
kind of a quasi confrontation here,

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.860
which is kind of cool.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:49.730
I think that sets it up.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.190
Let's take a look at this
clip from "Cobra Kai".

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.340
Is there anything else you need me to do?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.720
I'm sorry, sensei but...

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.553
Sensei?

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.363
Really?

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.860
Oh my God kid, I don't
know what he's told you,

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.490
but you shouldn't believe
a word this guy says

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.290
or you're going to end
up exactly like him.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.710
You and I,

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:10.543
this,

00:05:11.547 --> 00:05:13.297
you know, we're done.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:16.690
I'm right here, man.

00:05:27.359 --> 00:05:28.910
You know what, I'm really happy for you.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.340
This is a, I'm really
happy for your success.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.173
And,

00:05:32.173 --> 00:05:33.160
I'm happy that

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.610
and again, thank you so much

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.440
for destroying Jordan Schlansky for me.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.310
That's right.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:42.310
I owe you anytime you
need any video from me.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:44.590
If you can ever find someone
who's a big fan of mine,

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.660
I'll do the same--
I'll start looking.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:47.704
Start looking.
And I,

00:05:47.704 --> 00:05:49.008
it won't be that difficult.

00:05:49.008 --> 00:05:51.190
(laughter)

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.210
I love "I'll start looking".

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.320
Well, you set me up,

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.920
you threw me a beat (mumbles)
(laughter)

00:05:56.920 --> 00:06:00.162
That over the middle of
the plate I had a swing.

00:06:00.162 --> 00:06:00.995
Thank you.

00:06:00.995 --> 00:06:02.250
It was an illegal kick,

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.210
that you just gave to me.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.960
The first two seasons of "Cobra Kai"

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.320
are streaming now on Netflix and,

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.870
it is a really fun show.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.490
If you're not watching it,

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:12.340
get started.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.410
'Cause it's a joy and

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.770
Ralph, thank you so much.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.100
Really good talking to you.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:17.980
I appreciate it, man.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.400
Thank you so much.
Yeah, stay safe.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.250
Take care, man.

